# Generated / machine-specific build artifacts — never committed (mirrors the
# qr-scan / screen-guard / share-intent `.gitignore` discipline). `.tauri/` is the
# generated Tauri-API surface; `ios/.build/` holds SwiftPM + SourceKit index
# output (incl. binary `*.mdb`); `Package.resolved` re-resolves from the local
# `../.tauri/tauri-api` path at each build.
/.tauri
/ios/.build
/ios/Package.resolved
